WEBVTT

00:19:26.352 --> 00:19:30.456
Ndiqni gjurmet. Humbni. Jini te habitur dhe te inspiruar.

00:19:30.456 --> 00:19:35.075
E gjithe ajo "Cka", e gjithe ajo "Si" eshte atje jashte

00:19:35.075 --> 00:19:37.538
duke ju pritur ju per te zbuluar "pse",

00:19:37.569 --> 00:19:40.627
per tu zhytur dhe per ta percjelle ate.

00:19:40.627 --> 00:19:43.125
Ju faleminderit.

00:19:43.125 --> 00:19:50.237
(Duartrokitje)

Done by: Yll Sutaj